QUALITY ASSURANCE SERVICE LEVEL AGREEMENT

This Quality Assurance Service Level Agreement (the "Agreement") is made and entered into as of the date of generation, by and between XYZ Limited, a company incorporated under the laws of England and Wales, having its registered office at 45 King Street, Manchester, M2 3ND, United Kingdom ("XYZ"), and Chris de Keijzer, employee with the ID Iq-3229, residing at 1 Järnvägsgränd, Örnsköldsvik ("Client").

WHEREAS, XYZ desires to provide quality assurance services to the Client, and the Client desires to engage XYZ for such services, subject to the terms and conditions set forth herein;

NOW, THEREFORE, in consideration of the mutual covenants and promises contained herein, the parties hereto agree as follows:

1. Scope of Services

1.1 XYZ shall provide quality assurance services (the "Services") to the Client in accordance with the terms and conditions set forth herein. The Services shall include, but not be limited to, the following:

1.1.1 Product inspections and quality control processes;
1.1.2 Performance benchmarks for maintaining product quality;
1.1.3 Regular reporting and communication regarding the status of the Services;
1.1.4 Continuous improvement initiatives aimed at enhancing product quality and efficiency.

2. Service Levels

2.1 XYZ shall use commercially reasonable efforts to achieve the following service levels:

2.1.1 Inspection and testing of products within two (2) business days of receipt;
2.1.2 Reporting of inspection results within one (1) business day of completion of inspections;
2.1.3 Correction of non-conformities within three (3) business days of identification;
2.1.4 Implementation of continuous improvement initiatives within thirty (30) days of identification.

3. Fees and Payment

3.1 The Client shall pay XYZ a fee for the Services as set forth in Exhibit A attached hereto.

